  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Pixel Kitchen Converter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n  <script src=\"app.js\" defer></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"pixel-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">▦</div>\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">PIXEL KITCHEN</p>\n    <h1>Kitchen converter</h1>\n    <p class=\"intro\">Quickly scale a kitchen amount into the other measuring units.</p>\n\n    <form id=\"converter-form\">\n      <label for=\"amount\">Amount</label>\n      <input id=\"amount\" name=\"amount\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"any\" value=\"1\" inputmode=\"decimal\">\n      <label for=\"unit\">Starting unit</label>\n      <select id=\"unit\" name=\"unit\">\n        <option value=\"cups\">Cups</option>\n        <option value=\"tablespoons\">Tablespoons</option>\n        <option value=\"teaspoons\">Teaspoons</option>\n        <option value=\"millilitres\">Millilitres</option>\n      </select>\n      <button type=\"submit\">Convert amounts <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></button>\n    </form>\n\n    <section class=\"results\" aria-labelledby=\"results-title\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <h2 id=\"results-title\">Other measurements</h2>\n      <p class=\"source\" id=\"source\">1.0 cup equals:</p>\n      <ul id=\"results-list\"></ul>\n    </section>\n    <p class=\"ratio\">1 cup = 16 tbsp = 48 tsp = 240 ml</p>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "description": "Responsive, accessible converter page with labeled controls and live results."
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": "* { box-sizing: border-box; }\n:root {\n  color-scheme: light;\n  font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: #25352f;\n  background: #f3ead8;\n}\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 32px 16px;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  background-color: #f3ead8;\n  background-image: radial-gradient(#d8c7a6 1.5px, transparent 1.5px);\n  background-size: 20px 20px;\n}\n.card {\n  width: min(100%, 500px);\n  padding: clamp(24px, 7vw, 40px);\n  border: 3px solid #25352f;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background: #fffaf0;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #d27c4b;\n}\n.pixel-mark { color: #d27c4b; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1; }\n.eyebrow { margin: 16px 0 6px; color: #557a65; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .14em; }\nh1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 7vw, 2.4rem); line-height: 1.15; }\n.intro { margin: 12px 0 28px; color: #53615a; line-height: 1.5; }\nform { display: grid; gap: 10px; }\nlabel { font-weight: 700; }\ninput, select, button {\n  width: 100%;\n  min-height: 50px;\n  border: 2px solid #25352f;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  color: #25352f;\n  background: #fff;\n  font: inherit;\n}\ninput:focus, select:focus, button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #d27c4b; outline-offset: 3px; }\nbutton {\n  margin-top: 8px;\n  border-color: #557a65;\n  background: #557a65;\n  color: #fffaf0;\n  font-weight: 750;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background-color .15s, transform .15s, box-shadow .15s;\n}\nbutton:hover { background: #3e624f; }\nbutton:active { transform: translateY(2px); box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px #25352f66; }\n.results { margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 22px; border-top: 2px dashed #d8c7a6; }\nh2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.15rem; }\n.source { margin: 8px 0 12px; color: #53615a; }\n#results-list { display: grid; gap: 8px; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }\n#results-list li { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 12px; border-radius: 5px; background: #f3ead8; }\n#results-list strong { color: #3e624f; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.ratio { margin: 22px 0 0; color: #53615a; font-size: .9rem; text-align: center; }\n",
      "description": "Cohesive kitchen palette, pixel texture, responsive card, and clear interaction states."
    },
    {
      "path": "app.js",
      "content": "const factors = {\n  cups: 240,\n  tablespoons: 15,\n  teaspoons: 5,\n  millilitres: 1\n};\nconst labels = {\n  cups: \"cups\",\n  tablespoons: \"tablespoons\",\n  teaspoons: \"teaspoons\",\n  millilitres: \"millilitres\"\n};\nconst form = document.getElementById(\"converter-form\");\nconst amountInput = document.getElementById(\"amount\");\nconst unitSelect = document.getElementById(\"unit\");\nconst source = document.getElementById(\"source\");\nconst resultsList = document.getElementById(\"results-list\");\n\nfunction convert() {\n  const amount = Number(amountInput.value);\n  const from = unitSelect.value;\n  const valid = amountInput.value !== \"\" && Number.isFinite(amount) && amount >= 0;\n  resultsList.replaceChildren();\n\n  if (!valid) {\n    source.textContent = \"Enter a non-negative amount to see conversions.\";\n    return;\n  }\n\n  source.textContent = `${amount.toFixed(1)} ${labels[from]} equals:`;\n  for (const unit of Object.keys(factors)) {\n    if (unit === from) continue;\n    const converted = amount * factors[from] / factors[unit];\n    const item = document.createElement(\"li\");\n    const name = document.createElement(\"span\");\n    const value = document.createElement(\"strong\");\n    name.textContent = labels[unit];\n    value.textContent = `${converted.toFixed(1)} ${unit === \"millilitres\" ? \"ml\" : unit === \"tablespoons\" ? \"tbsp\" : unit === \"teaspoons\" ? \"tsp\" : \"cups\"}`;\n    item.append(name, value);\n    resultsList.append(item);\n  }\n}\n\nform.addEventListener(\"submit\", event => {\n  event.preventDefault();\n  convert();\n});\namountInput.addEventListener(\"input\", convert);\nunitSelect.addEventListener(\"change\", convert);\nconvert();\n",
      "description": "Plain JavaScript conversion using millilitres as the common base; results rounded to one decimal."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Kitchen Converter\n\nAn offline browser app for converting cooking amounts between cups, tablespoons, teaspoons, and millilitres.\n\n## Run\n\nOpen `index.html` in a modern browser. No server, installation, or internet connection is required.\n\n## Conversion ratios\n\nThe converter uses the supplied equivalences: 1 cup = 16 tablespoons = 48 teaspoons = 240 millilitres. Enter a non-negative amount and choose its unit; the other three units update automatically and display one decimal place.\n",
      "description": "Launch instructions and conversion behavior."
    }
  ]
}